	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, you become more able to recover from your sacrifices between offensives. With a successful medicine check against DC 15, you may roll a number of d8s equal to your spellcasting modifier and recover that many hit points during a short rest. Alternatively, you can recover one level of fatigue or strife with the same DC 15 medicine check.</p><p>You can only benefit from your careful recovery once per long rest.</p>",
